  "changes": [
    "Match native unbound-character Generic ordnance dispatch; return inventory close to initial room UI with Escape guard; Feuer depth hover reports selected tube limit in all report modes; quit-time UI precaution. No launch-rule or per-tube printed-label change. Future viewport checked-tube dials queued."
  ],
