    "compile": "passed",
    "offline": "passed",
    "in_game": "not-run",
    "notes": [
      "Full supplied UBOAT/Unity/Harmony reference compilation passed; 375 targeted offline assertions passed: 316 existing and 59 cleanup/navigation/ordnance/handoff. ZIP/source/CRCs verified. No live .28 run. Owner .27 video/log reviewed; autosave success=True, no TorpedoRoom runtime exception or exit crash stack. Exit crash not diagnosed or claimed fixed."
    ]
  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Native inventory Escape/task continuation, saving/exit, UI/input and MP need live testing. Exit crash remains undiagnosed; quit guard is precaution only. Aft physical inner-door/flood mismatch remains undiagnosed; no physical-state fix claimed. Feuer clipping retune remains queued. No config migration or config-only cleanup command; no depth-rule changes."
